            'Bills overhaul: record bills paid in the past (real payment date separate from creation) + an already-paid back-fill; auto-accrual of owed periods when a due date passes (bill_periods) so "we owe the company" is tracked before marking paid; per-user split of each period (bill_shares) with Split-equally or manual amounts, paid in partial installments tagged from cost/profit (bill_share_payments); dedicated Payment History popup (separate from the activity log) + the note shown on the bill card; a share made for another user stays pending until they accept/refuse/edit it (edit smaller, pay the rest later) with a "Bills awaiting you" inbox and who-paid/who-owes per period (only the assigned user or an admin can pay/respond); each installment has a disposition remove|keep (remove deducts from the books, keep just records it); the dashboard nets "remove" bills out of Net Profit (from-cost also into the Cost card) with a printable per-user P&L panel; per-bill filtered print (all/owed/settled) + a global all-users bills report; a recorded payment (installment or legacy single-payer) can be voided with a reason (voided_at/voided_by/void_reason) — kept in history but dropped from paid totals/We-owe/dashboard; "Cover remaining" adds shares for just the uncovered gap left by a refuse/edit-down (other-user shares stay pending) so a period can still settle; every share/period action (split/pay/accept/refuse/edit/void/cover) is mirrored into the per-bill Activity timeline; the dashboard "Bills — we owe" card shows the real accrued owed (open/partial periods), categories are an icon grid shown on the card, and deleting a bill with money still owed warns first',
