            'Starter catalog + currency picker: a fresh install seeds an editable/deletable default catalog once (Cash: US Dollar, Euro; Crypto: Bitcoin, USDT) so you do not start empty — guarded so deleting them never brings them back and never injected onto restored data; and Settings offers a pre-built Currency Symbol picker (DZD/USD/EUR/GBP/…), still falling back to a Custom free-text symbol',
            'Purchase batch picker: when selling, the "Select Purchase Batch" step is a card picker (opened from the sale dialog) instead of a cramped dropdown. Each batch is a card with a Cash-buy / Coin-swap tag, cost per unit, total cost, quantity bought / sold / available (after reservations), supplier, and how much that exact batch has MADE so far (margin from the order lines sold out of it, computed server-side and returned on /api/purchases as realized_profit/realized_revenue). The picker has search + a type filter (all / cash / swap) + sort (newest / oldest / most-available / cheapest / most-made); a single available batch auto-selects',
            'Image crop upgrades: the logo crop dialog (wheel/pinch zoom, drag, rule-of-thirds grid, Fit) is now also used for PRODUCT and CATEGORY image uploads (square), so every image gets the same framing tools. The initial crop auto-centers on the image content (handles logos with lopsided whitespace padding). Transparent images get a Background option in the dialog — kept transparent by default, or flattened to white / black / a custom color (better for printed receipts). A circle crop shows a non-blocking warning when content would be clipped in the corners. All client-side; logos/images still store as before',
